SUMMARY:Circuit Hacking Mondays: 🧟 Build a Zombie Detector
DESCRIPTION:Noisebridge Hackerspace 🧟 **The zombie apocalypse is here... or maybe it's just someone using too much hand sanitizer. Build your own Arduino-powered Zombie Detector with a gas sensor and a moving servo gauge. This beginner-friendly workshop includes all the parts you'll need—just bring your curiosity and sense of humor!** Please bring a laptop if you have one but come anyway if do not. Instructions: https://phptuts.github.io/CircuitHackingMondays/zombie-detector/ | Source: DC415 San Francisco | Tags: security | https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/315784328/
